000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSNAT.
000300*    KSDSREAD, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000600 FILE-CONTROL.
000700     SELECT KSDS-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
000800         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
000900         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001000         RECORD KEY IS KSDS-KEY
001100         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 FILE SECTION.
001400 FD  KSDS-FILE
001500     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001600     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
001700 01  KSDS-RECORD.
001800     02  KSDS-KEY                PIC X(10).
001900     02  FILLER                  PIC X(70).
002000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002100 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
002200 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002300     88  END-OF-FILE                      VALUE 'Y'.
002400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002500 000-INITIATE.
002600     DISPLAY 'KSDSREAD: READ KSDS SEQUENTIALLY'.
002700     DISPLAY '--------------------------------'.
002800     DISPLAY ' '.
002900     OPEN INPUT KSDS-FILE.
003000 010-PROCESS.
003100     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-DATA THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
003200 020-TERMINATE.
003300     CLOSE KSDS-FILE.
